    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Clarity and publication",
     "texto": [
      "Keep the exposition **ringkas** and **runtut**. A public letter may be **diterbitkan** so that other people learn about the matter; that is why politeness and verifiable details matter."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
